# Slipway edge proxy: bootstrap configuration.
#
# Only the global options live here. The Slipway API renders the site blocks
# from its routes and loads the complete configuration through the admin API.
# Caddy runs with --resume, so it keeps the last loaded configuration across
# restarts and reads this file only when nothing has been loaded yet.
#
# The admin API listens on all interfaces of the container so that the API can
# reach it as caddy:2019 on the slipway-proxy network. Never publish port 2019.
{
	admin 0.0.0.0:2019
	email {$SLIPWAY_ACME_EMAIL}
	cert_issuer acme
}
